@startuml
title GoF Pattern : Memento+Singleton

note as GoFLabel
  **<<Memento+Singleton>>**
end note

class "Editor" <<Singleton>> {
  - state: Memento
  - save(): void
  + getInstance(): Editor
}
class "Memento" {
  - state: String
  - save(): void
  + restore(): void
}
class "Caretaker" {
  - memento: Memento
  - save(): void
  + restore(): void
}

Editor --> Memento : has
Editor --> Caretaker : has
Caretaker --> Memento : has
GoFLabel .. Editor
@enduml